{"id":"wb-7-46","name":"虞坂古盐道","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"虞坂古盐道","text":"虞坂古盐道，又名虞坂、虞坂道、虞坂茅津道、盐坂，是中国古代的一条重要运盐道路，同时也被认为是“假道伐虢”和“伯乐相马”的发生地。1956年道路被废弃，20世纪80年代被重新发现。2013年，虞坂古盐道被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%99%9E%E5%9D%82%E5%8F%A4%E7%9B%90%E9%81%93","revisionId":89626764,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89626764","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/fd0c6b620fc3e1107fc37fc1.jpg","title":"Yuban Ancient Salt Road in 1970 by CORONA satellite.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Yuban_Ancient_Salt_Road_in_1970_by_CORONA_satellite.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b3/Yuban_Ancient_Salt_Road_in_1970_by_CORONA_satellite.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"CIA/NRO/USGS","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","caption":"​1970年原山西运城与平陆交界处的虞坂古盐道卫星地图。","width":320,"height":226,"matchEvidence":"对应百科配图的名称与所在地一致"}}